# Membership summary

The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-75db6bbcf33f1a8bbf10048d19dcb9145af348b2 "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

The expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense [[cite:obs-bc33ba3b5677fa201c056c41109caa62109f4299 "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
